B.arJ=new A.hC("11:00am","Blessings & Bride's sendoff","At the Bride's residence, family and friends wish her well before she makes her way to the church.",B.Lx)
B.LH=new A.e3(984520,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.arK=new A.hC("1:00pm","Nuptial Mass","Witness the exchange of vows before God, family and friends as we enter into the sacred covenant of Holy Matrimony.",B.LH)
B.LI=new A.e3(985256,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.arP=new A.hC("2:15pm","Receiving Line & Group Photo","A wonderful opportunity to personally congratulate the newlyweds, share your well wishes, and create lasting memories together before the reception begins.",B.LI)
B.LC=new A.e3(61813,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.arL=new A.hC("3:00pm","Refreshments & Private Photos","Guests are warmly invited to enjoy light refreshments, tea & coffee in the Church Hall while the newlyweds go off to a private photo shoot. If you have booked nearby accommodation, please feel free to take this opportunity to freshen up and relax before returning for the reception celebrations.",B.LC)
B.LB=new A.e3(61812,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.arN=new A.hC("5:00pm","Reception Guest Arrival","Guests arrive at the reception venue and enjoy welcome drinks.",B.LB)
B.Ly=new A.e3(61240,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.arM=new A.hC("6:00pm","Grand Entrance","The newlyweds make their entrance and the evening begins.",B.Ly)
B.qq=new A.e3(61223,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.arO=new A.hC("6:30pm","Toast & Speeches","Pop some bubbly and raise a glass. Its time to toast the newlyweds!",B.qq)
B.arQ=new A.hC("7:00pm","First Dance","The newlyweds dance to their first song as a couple.",B.qq)
B.LD=new A.e3(62229,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.arR=new A.hC("7:30pm","Buffet Opens","Help yourselves to a selection of Goan and Polish cuisine, embracing the union of our two cultures.",B.LD)
